OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 FEB
OL,4,G1600FIggy Pop
OL,5,     GIggy serves up a sonic cocktail
OL,6,     Gto soundtrack your afternoon.
OL,7,     GIncluding a selection of female-
OL,8,     Gfronted Japanese punk by the
OL,9,     Glikes of Kyosei, Osoroshia
OL,10,     GKakumei and Otoboke Beaver.
OL,11,G1800FMary Anne Hobbs
OL,12,     GWith a borderless spectrum of
OL,13,     Gmusic, new experiments in
OL,14,     GStorytelling and sound.
OL,15,G2000FStuart Maconie's Freak Zone
OL,16,     GStuart's featured album is
OL,17,     GDorothy Carter's acid folk drone
OL,18,     Gmasterpiece Waillee Waillee. Plus
OL,19,     GKevin Ayers, Magazine and a
OL,20,     Gsmidgen of Polish jazz funk.
